<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<section xml:id="sec-practicing-2-5-1-progressions" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Practicing 2-5-1 Progressions</title>
<p> This progression is built from a 4 note grip (chord formed by content of the grip shown above the shape) and a bass note that is the root of the progression chord (named in the notation).</p>
   <!---->===== Row 1: Shapes 1-4 =====-->
